1.1 This standard specifies material properties and performance requirements for the following categories of drainage geo-composites:
a) Category I - Geonet based drainage geo-composites;
b) Category II - Geospacer based drainage geo-composites;
c) Category III - Geomat based drainage geo-composites; and
